<title>USA: USDA postpones release of farm chemical survey.</title>
<headline>USDA postpones release of farm chemical survey.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said Monday it postponed the release of its Agricultural Chemical Usage report for field crops until May 16.</p>
<p>The survey of chemical use and farm economic data had been scheduled for release last Friday, but was delayed by reviews of the data, the agency said.</p>
</text>
